WEBVTT

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:15.450
Fukui Prefectural Middle Schoo Athletic Competition
Boys Volleyball Tournament Venue

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:33.040
He's left-handed?

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:37.620
A spike serve!

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:41.200
Yeah!

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:44.450
How is he so calm?

00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:45.540
Sorry!

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:51.830
He got the ball up with his right hand.
Is he ambidextrous?

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:53.080
Yeah!

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:55.330
Who the hell is that kid?

00:00:56.870 --> 00:00:59.620
Kimichika Haijima.

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:02.740
He was at a powerhouse school
in Tokyo up until last year.

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:05.950
He was a starting member
and setter as a second-year.

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:09.660
He's even been picked as MVP in a tournament.

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:12.240
Kimichika... Haijima.

00:01:16.490 --> 00:01:18.950
<i>We were so scared that we went numb</i>

00:01:18.950 --> 00:01:21.330
<i>And our legs buckled from under us</i>

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:26.290
<i>We still can't forget the tears</i>
<i>that fell back then even now</i>

