00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:40.950
<i>What should we do?</i>
<i>We're not used to facing adversity</i>

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:46.080
<i>So our resolve's definitely not all there</i>

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:48.490
<i>Back then, we were just</i>

00:01:48.490 --> 00:01:50.830
<i>Envious of others and</i>

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:55.580
<i>Angry at something we couldn't see</i>

00:01:55.580 --> 00:01:58.120
<i>We just kept glaring at the next step</i>

00:01:58.120 --> 00:02:00.490
<i>That we could've easily taken</i>

00:02:00.490 --> 00:02:05.450
<i>And it was eating away at us silently</i>

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:09.240
<i>We were so scared that we went numb</i>

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:11.660
<i>And our legs buckled from under us</i>

00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:16.540
<i>We still can't forget the tears</i>
<i>that fell back then even now</i>

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:21.330
<i>Even though we're so frail we might break,</i>
<i>we still continued to seek love</i>

00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:26.450
<i>We don't want to forget the reason</i>
<i>we're standing on this stage</i>

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:31.240
<i>Because you're the one who made me stronger</i>

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:35.740
<i>I give you this lovely ballad</i>
<i>within this beautiful attack</i>

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:48.540
April, the next year

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:51.540
Prefectural Nanafu Seiin High School

00:02:51.990 --> 00:02:56.660
All right, let's have all you first years
who just joined introduce yourselves.

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:58.660
If you've played before, tell us your position.

00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:01.450
Let's start with Ryo Nagato. Where you at?

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:02.660
Here.

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:05.240
I'm Ryo Nagato from Class 1-E.

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:09.540
I come from Monshiro MS
and I'm about 178 cm tall.

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:12.580
I basically played middle blocker.

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:13.410
Next.

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:14.540
Right.

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:15.950
I'm Yuni Kuroba.

00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:19.910
I'm from Monshiro MS. I'm 184 cm tall.

00:03:19.910 --> 00:03:22.330
I played wing spiker.

00:03:25.290 --> 00:03:30.580
Kuroba, Nagato. Isn't there one more
from your middle school?

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:34.660
What's wrong? Doesn't Haijima
go to this school, too?

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:37.200
Kimichika...

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:39.620
...Haijima.

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:41.700
Well, Haijima...

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:44.950
Ever since the prefectural tournament last year,
he stopped showing up to club.

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:47.950
Apparently, he doesn't play volleyball anymore.

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:47.950
There's some <i>senpai</i> looking for you.

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:53.040
Class 1-F

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:53.200
Can I help you?

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.990
I'm a third year here
and my name is Oda. This is Aoki.

00:03:55.990 --> 00:03:58.240
We're the captain and vice captain
of the boys' volleyball team.

00:03:58.240 --> 00:04:01.160
He plays middle blocker and I'm a wing spiker.

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:03.700
His position's totally obvious but...

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:06.660
You're a wing spike?

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:07.620
What?

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:08.830
Are you trying to get me to join?

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:11.870
I'm glad you pick up on things quickly.

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:15.580
Why didn't you come check out our club?

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:18.540
You got through the prelims for the Inter-High,

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:22.080
but lost in the first match in the finals, 1-2.

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:24.950
You lost 0-2 in the second round
at the Fall Tournament.

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:27.870
You lost 0-2 in first round
of the Spring Tournament prelims.

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:30.240
You didn't go to the rookie's match.

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:35.080
There's no point for me to be on a team
like that if I'm the only good player.

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:36.370
Hang on a second!

00:04:36.370 --> 00:04:38.700
We're not done talking yet, first year!

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:42.080
Shin, let's leave him and go.

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:43.830
Why are you

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:47.040
clinging onto your position so much?

00:04:50.580 --> 00:04:51.910
Wait, what?!

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:01.030
Episode 3: 'A Dog's Perspective and a Giraffe's Perspective'

00:04:58.950 --> 00:05:01.990
Hey, come on, Oda.

00:05:01.990 --> 00:05:04.580
It's not too late to start judo.

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:07.240
You'd be able to play
in a tournament in no time.

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:09.990
Just stop. You're so persistent.

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:11.950
Haven't you played enough volleyball?

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:13.910
You lost the prefectural tournament, didn't you?

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:16.040
There's still the Spring Tournament.

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:18.620
Oda! I'm being serious here!

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:22.120
With your height and stature,
you're better off doing judo over volleyball!

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:25.160
Are you just going to waste your talents?

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:26.950
Shut up.

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:31.240
Aoki.

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:32.830
We can't do anything outside
today because of the rain,

00:05:32.830 --> 00:05:34.490
so we'll have a meeting in the club room.

00:05:34.490 --> 00:05:37.370
Got it.

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:39.040
Did something happen, Shin?

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:41.200
N-No.

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:42.540
I see.

