Oh, sorry.

00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:59.370
The prefectural prelims last week

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:08.240
If only... we had Haijima back then.

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:10.160
Shin.

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:13.370
You wanna see who'll be playing
in the ball game festival for volleyball?

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:16.910
Things are looking interesting this year.

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:22.610
Ball Game Festival Boys

00:06:16.910 --> 00:06:19.200
The players for Team C...

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:23.330
Misao Aoki, Akito Kanno, Yuni Kuroba...

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:25.330
Three guys from the volleyball team?

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:26.990
Who the hell thought of this lineup?

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:29.540
Wouldn't this all-star lineup be cheating?

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:33.120
It's not against the rules as long as you
don't have more than three from the team.

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:34.160
Though...

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:36.700
Worst case scenario, I might have to drop out.

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:38.950
I have to help manage the thing, too.

00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:42.040
Don't drop out! It's no fun if you don't play.

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:43.540
I'm not gonna hold back.

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:44.910
You'd better not!

00:06:44.910 --> 00:06:48.240
If you hold back at all,
I'm never speaking to you again!

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:51.950
Oh, come on. Don't be like that.

00:06:51.950 --> 00:06:53.870
As for Team F that I'm on...

